[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2448104833","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98531#issuecomment-2448104833","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98531","id":2448104833,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6R6x2B","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-30T19:01:54Z","updated_at":"2024-10-30T19:02:54Z","body":"Try reducing the resolution scale factor in the project settings (**Scaling 3D > Scale**) to a value between 0.5 and 0.7. Most 3D mobile projects don't render at native resolution for performance reasons.\r\n\r\n> I read an official article that SSGI and other effects are not optimized in Godot yet and will improved with upcoming releases, so hopefully Glow will be part of that upcoming optimizations\r\n\r\nThe implementation of glow in Mobile closely follows the one used in Forward+, except it only uses fragment shaders instead of compute (due to poor compute shader support on mobile GPUs).\r\n\r\nCompatibility uses a low-end-oriented glow implementation with less options available. It could be ported to Mobile, but this would change the appearance of projects that rely on the current glow implementation (unless we keep two codepaths side-by-side).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2448104833/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2449322173","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98531#issuecomment-2449322173","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98531","id":2449322173,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6R_bC9","user":{"login":"Kajinor","id":7585932,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1ODU5MzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7585932?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kajinor","html_url":"https://github.com/Kajinor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kajinor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kajinor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kajinor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kajinor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kajinor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kajinor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kajinor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kajinor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kajinor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-31T08:38:20Z","updated_at":"2024-10-31T08:42:26Z","body":"> Try reducing the resolution scale factor in the project settings (Scaling 3D > Scale) to a value between 0.5 and 0.7. Most 3D mobile projects don't render at native resolution for performance reasons.\r\n\r\nHmm I tried that, I set the Scaling 3D to 0.5 and the FPS drops even a bit more! It goes down to 28-30 FPS then....\r\n\r\nAlso, as I mentioned, the Glow is not even visible on mobile, I don't get any glow effect no matter how much I play with the glow related settings (e.g., setting HDR Threshold below 1.0). On PC, the Glow is working. I use Mobile Renderer on PC as well, so its the same Renderer.\r\n\r\n> Compatibility uses a low-end-oriented glow implementation with less options available. It could be ported to Mobile, but this would change the appearance of projects that rely on the current glow implementation (unless we keep two codepaths side-by-side).\r\n\r\nI think you should keep two codepaths then if possible. The thing is, in Unreal and Unity I get decent 60 FPS (probably above if I would stop locking the FPS there) with nice looking glow effects even if I choose Vulkan. \r\n\r\nI think glowing is essential for many games. So if Glow makes the game unplayable on a $300 Galaxy A35 mid-range phone, which has just been released in March 2024, then I think an additional code-path is definitely worth it. I mean so far, I only rendererd a Cube without shadows, sky, and other stuff.\r\n\r\nThe Compatibility Renderer solves this, but it lacks other features like Decals, DOF, etc. which GLES3 Renderer in Godot 3.6 all supports btw. (except for Decals)\r\n\r\nSo the issue on Mobile with Godot 4.0 in a Nutshell is:\r\n\r\n- Mobile Renderer is too slow for production use\r\n- Compatibility Renderer lacks too many features\r\n\r\nDon't get me wrong, I saw the huge improvements which have been added to Compatibility Renderer with the most recent updates. But I also read that the Compatibility Renderer is now \"feature complete\" so I don't expect more additions to it.\r\n\r\nRight now, Godot 3.6 is actually the much better version if it would have the latest GDScript, GDExtension and Workflow additions like Godot 4.0 has and more frequent updates. Rendering vice, Godot 4.0 in many cases brings less features and poorer performance on Mobile right now and I think that is something which should be changed.\r\n\r\nEven on my Apple M1 Macbook Air, Mobile Renderer Glow drags down performance in a way it shouldn't be.\r\n\r\nAnyway, I think Godot has great potential on Mobile, please just think about an additional code path OR adding more features to Compatibility Renderer. That would be awesome.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2449322173/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2623262098","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98531#issuecomment-2623262098","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98531","id":2623262098,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cW82S","user":{"login":"Kazox61","id":93524528,"node_id":"U_kgDOBZMSMA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93524528?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazox61","html_url":"https://github.com/Kazox61","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazox61/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazox61/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazox61/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazox61/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazox61/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazox61/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazox61/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazox61/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazox61/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-30T00:36:37Z","updated_at":"2025-01-30T00:36:37Z","body":"The performance drops even to 30 fps on a high end mobile device. This is a huge problem for projects targeting mobile devices. I'm not sure what to do now? Should I move to the Compatibility Renderer? @Kajinor what did you do?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2623262098/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2625230221","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98531#issuecomment-2625230221","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98531","id":2625230221,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cedWN","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-30T18:11:59Z","updated_at":"2025-01-30T18:11:59Z","body":"I would recommend using Compatibility for now, as its glow implementation is much faster on mobile devices.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godot