rs/Kajinor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kajinor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kajinor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kajinor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kajinor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kajinor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kajinor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-20T18:55:00Z","updated_at":"2025-02-20T18:56:25Z","body":"It is still happening to me with latest Godot 4.4 Beta 4. The thing is that the glow is **not even visible** on my Android Phone, its not even working. But on my PC it is visible (Also using Mobile Renderer, same settings). That makes me thinking that the Renderer might run into an error or something and that this error is the reason for the bad fps and not the implementation of the glow effect. (I checked logcat -s godot but there is nothing except:  ERROR: QueuePresentKHR failed with error: VK_ERROR_SURFACE_LOST_KHR whenever I quit the App but I guess its nothing important)\n\nOr maybe there is just a wrong setting (perhaps a \".mobile\" setting), but I already played with almost all the settings and nothing changes. (If I change the Glow Blend Mode from Additive to Replace, I only see a black screen on my Phone. Not sure if that is interesting.)\n\n@beicause Did you apply any changes to the MRP I attached? Changed some settings? Or did it just work for you as it is?\n\nAnyway, whatever it is, would be cool to have a fix or a workaround soon. Thanks","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2672400763/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/iss